11	 * value is first set to the server's current date; then the effective date — supplied or defaulted —
12	 * must fall on a business day: a Saturday or Sunday is rolled forward to the following Monday. The
13	 * adjusted value is written back onto the (shared) {@link OwnerFieldsDto}, so every later step sees it:
14	 * {@link RequireDailyOwnerLimit} counts per adjusted business day, {@link BuildOwner} stores it, the
