7	 * detection is expressed through. The key joins three normalized parts with {@code '|'}:
8	 *
9	 * <ol>
10	 * <li>the telephone in E.164 form (see {@link TelephoneNormalizer}),</li>
11	 * <li>the email lower-cased, or empty when absent (see {@link EmailNormalizer}), and</li>
12	 * <li>the {@code householdId}, or empty when the owner does not share a household.</li>
